        the field `trainArgs`:
        ```py
        pipe = c3.KerasPipe.convert(model, spec)  # given some model and spec
        hps = {
           'trainArgs.epochs': 50,
           'trainArgs.initial_epoch': 1
        }
        pipe = pipe.withHyperparams(hps)
        ```
        See {@link Ann.ML} for more details.
